{"type":"thinking","text":"Let me start by understanding the task. I'm a detached fan-out lineage executor for deep-research workflow. I need to:\n\n1. Read the SKILL.md for deep-research\n2. Read the prompt pack iteration template and agent definition\n3. Check for steer.md\n4. Run phase_init, phase_main_loop, phase_synthesis\n5. Research topic: What do the two checked-in DeepSeek Harness route patches under .dsh/patches/ declare (endpoint, model id, reasoning effort, compat flags), and do they agree with each other? Answer in under 200 words.\n6. Write files only inside the lineage directory\n7. Use append-mode-event.cjs gateway for state records\n8. Run reduce-state.cjs\n9. Output FANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:dsh-live-2\n\nLet me start by reading the required files and exploring the directory.\n\nFirst, let me check the current state of the lineage directory and read the skill files."}
