{"type":"tool_result","callId":"call_01_qyxK3Msf75ZMxmi94D3v9533","status":"completed","result":"===== .dsh/patches/guards.patch.yml =====\n     1\t- insert:\n     2\t    - id: repo-guards\n     3\t      name: ../plugins/repo-guards/index.mjs\n     4\t      config:\n     5\t        adapters:\n     6\t          promptAdvisor: false\n===== .dsh/patches/lineage.patch.yml =====\n     1\t# Disables telemetry, session logging and goal or plan workflows to keep harness runs local and focused.\n     2\t- id: session-telemetry-otel\n     3\t  config:\n     4\t    mode: DISABLED\n     5\t- id: session-log-deepseek\n     6\t  disabled: true\n     7\t- id: goal-round-driver\n     8\t  disabled: true\n     9\t- id: command-goal\n    10\t  disabled: true\n    11\t- id: plan-mode\n    12\t  disabled: true\n===== .dsh/patches/mcp-code-mode.patch.yml =====\n     1\t# Mounts one code_mode MCP server over stdio; MCP is opt-in, so a dispatch sees it only when it adds this patch.\n     2\t- insert:\n     3\t    - id: mcp-code-mode\n     4\t      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client'\n     5\t      config:\n     6\t        serverName: code_mode\n     7\t        transport: stdio\n     8\t        command: node\n     9\t        args:\n    10\t          - .skilled/bin/mcp-code-mode-launcher.cjs\n    11\t        # A dispatch runs outside the checkout, so the root comes from this patch file's own --patch path.\n    12\t        cwd: !!js >-\n    13\t          (() => {\n    14\t            const fs = process.getBuiltinModule('node:fs');\n    15\t            const path = process.getBuiltinModule('node:path');\n    16\t            const launcher = (root) => fs.existsSync(path.join(root, '.skilled', 'bin', 'mcp-code-mode-launcher.cjs'));\n    17\t            const argv = process.argv;\n    18\t            for (let i = 0; i < argv.length; i += 1) {\n    19\t              const value = argv[i] === '--patch' ? argv[i + 1] : argv[i].startsWith('--patch=') ? argv[i].slice(8) : '';\n    20\t              if (!value || path.basename(value) !== 'mcp-code-mode.patch.yml') continue;\n    21\t              const root = path.resolve(path.dirname(value), '..', '..');\n    22\t              if (launcher(root)) return root;\n    23\t            }\n    24\t            let dir = process.cwd();\n    25\t            for (;;) {\n    26\t              if (launcher(dir)) return dir;\n    27\t              const parent = path.dirname(dir);\n    28\t              if (parent === dir) return process.cwd();\n    29\t              dir = parent;\n    30\t            }\n    31\t          })()\n    32\t        env:\n    33\t          UTCP_CONFIG_FILE: .utcp_config.json\n    34\t        # Bounds eager startup and the first tool sync so a hung launcher cannot stall the dispatch.\n    35\t        startupTimeoutMs: 60000\n===== .dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml =====\n     1\t# Pins dispatch to LLM Gateway's DeepSeek V4.1 Flash instead of the base default route.\n     2\t- id: llm-pi-ai\n     3\t  config:\n     4\t    providers:\n     5\t      llmgateway:\n     6\t        displayName: LLM Gateway\n     7\t        apiKeyEnv: LLMGATEWAY_API_KEY\n     8\t        api: openai-completions\n     9\t        baseURL: https://api.llmgateway.io/v1\n    10\t        compat:\n    11\t          thinkingFormat: deepseek\n    12\t          supportsDeveloperRole: false\n    13\t        models:\n    14\t          - id: deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017\n    15\t            name: DeepSeek V4.1 Flash\n    16\t            reasoningEfforts:\n    17\t              off:\n    18\t              high: high\n    19\t              max: max\n    20\t- id: agent-default-model\n    21\t  config:\n    22\t    provider: llmgateway\n    23\t    model: deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017\n    24\t    reasoningEffort: max\n===== .dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml =====\n     1\t# Pins dispatch to OpenCode Go's DeepSeek V4.1 Flash instead of the base default;\n     2\t# the endpoint is unverified until a keyed run proves it.\n     3\t- id: llm-pi-ai\n     4\t  config:\n     5\t    providers:\n     6\t      opencode-go:\n     7\t        displayName: OpenCode Go\n     8\t        apiKeyEnv: OPENCODE_API_KEY\n     9\t        api: openai-completions\n    10\t        baseURL: https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1\n    11\t        compat:\n    12\t          thinkingFormat: deepseek\n    13\t          supportsDeveloperRole: false\n    14\t        models:\n    15\t          - id: deepseek-v4.1-flash\n    16\t            name: DeepSeek V4.1 Flash\n    17\t            reasoningEfforts:\n    18\t              off:\n    19\t              high: high\n    20\t              max: max\n    21\t- id: agent-default-model\n    22\t  config:\n    23\t    provider: opencode-go\n    24\t    model: deepseek-v4.1-flash\n    25\t    reasoningEffort: max\n"}
