/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/004-dsh-runtime-folder-and-patches/implementation-summary.md:61:You can point a headless dispatch at `.dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml` or `.dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml`, add `.dsh/patches/lineage.patch.yml`, and the composed config selects that route's provider and model at reasoning effort `max`. Telemetry is `DISABLED` and `session-log-deepseek`, `goal-round-driver`, `command-goal` and `plan-mode` are off. Each route provider carries `compat.thinkingFormat: deepseek` and `compat.supportsDeveloperRole: false` and declares the levels `off`, `high` and `max` for its one model. `.dsh/SYNC.md` lists every entry in the folder with its mechanism and source and gives the drift check. `.dsh/README.md` is the operator entry point. `.gitignore` line 234 ignores `/.dsh/skills/local-*`.\nspecs/cli-external-orchestratio","truncated":true}
